WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:05.075
Atmosphere, biosphere, hydrosphere and geosphere overlap and interact.

2
00:00:05.876 --> 00:00:09.476
Air, living things, water and rock: Earth's four spheres.

3
00:00:12.897 --> 00:00:15.272
A tree is part of the biosphere.

4
00:00:18.832 --> 00:00:21.482
The ocean is part of the hydrosphere.

5
00:00:23.536 --> 00:00:27.686
Soil sits where spheres meet: rock, water, air and living things.
